{"product_id":"no-more-pms-the-medically-proven-womens-nutritional-advisory-service-programme","title":"No More PMS! The Medically Proven Women's Nutritional Advisory Service Programme","description":"\u003cp\u003eNo More PMS! No more symptomsNo more suffering-within 4 months.Maryon Stewart and her team at The Women's Nutritional Advisory Service have pioneered a highly successful programme to overcome pre-menstrual syndrome enabling nine out of ten women to find relief within 4 months.No More PMS! draws on over 14 years of scientifically ground --breaking work from the WNAS programme. It will enable you to devise a tailor-made diet to overcome PMS and includes the latest advice on:  The cause of PMS In-depth personal stories Precise dietary changes supported by scientific explanation The role of supplements  Why regular exercise is so important\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 135 x 216\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Maryon Stewart | Guy Abraham | Alan Stewart\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780091816223\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 302\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45885721968793,"sku":"13RF9780091816223","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/691418062a00e_No_More_PMS__The_Medically_Proven_Women_s_Nutritional_Advisory_Service_Programme.jpg?v=1762966070","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/no-more-pms-the-medically-proven-womens-nutritional-advisory-service-programme","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}